---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import OutcomeLabel from '../../components/OutcomeLabel.astro';
import ReproductionLabel from '../../components/ReproductionLabel.astro';
import { previews, recordUrl, sourceUrl, assetUrl } from '../../lib/evidence';
---
<SiteLayout title="Research previews" description="Four compact research directions retain their actual infrastructure, dated-analysis, design-only and rights-blocked maturity. No new performance result is implied." type="preview-index" reproduction="report_transcription">
  <header class="page-heading"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/research/">Research</a> / Other directions</p><span class="eyebrow">Four compact lanes / Explicit maturity</span><h1>Work at<br />different stages.</h1><p class="lede">These directions sit beside the six featured Indian-equity cases. Their scope and unfinished prerequisites remain part of the record.</p><p class="small">No strategy performance or live capability is claimed for these directions.</p></header>
  <nav aria-label="Preview lanes" class="download-links" style="margin-left:0;justify-content:start;gap:20px">{previews.map(preview=><a href={`#${preview.id}`}>{preview.title}</a>)}</nav>
  {previews.map(preview=><section data-pagefind-ignore class="section" id={preview.id} aria-labelledby={`title-${preview.id}`}><span class="eyebrow">Research direction / {preview.id}</span><h2 id={`title-${preview.id}`}>{preview.title}</h2><div class="outcomes"><OutcomeLabel status={preview.status}/><ReproductionLabel level={preview.reproduction_level}/></div><p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px">{preview.maturity}</p><div class="prose" style="margin-bottom:0"><p>{preview.summary}</p><div class="two-columns"><div><h3>What exists</h3><ul>{preview.what_exists.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div><div><h3>What remains</h3><ul>{preview.what_remains.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div></div>{preview.excluded && <><h3>Material kept outside this publication</h3><ul>{preview.excluded.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></>}<h3>Reviewed records</h3><ul>{preview.record_ids.map(id=><li><a href={recordUrl(id)}><code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">{id}</code></a></li>)}</ul><p class="small">Sources: {preview.source_ids.map((id,index)=><>{index>0 && ' · '}<a href={sourceUrl(id)}>{id}</a></>)}. Original files remain unavailable; source paths and hashes provide provenance.</p></div></section>)}
  <section class="section prose"><h2>Keep scope visible.</h2><p>Infrastructure can be implemented while live discovery is blocked. Dated analysis and forecasts remain distinct from tested strategy returns. A design review is not an implemented predictive model, and a return-blind registration is not a performance result.</p><p><a href="/evidence/">Read the evidence policy and scope definitions</a> · <a href="/research/catalog/">Browse all reviewed records</a> · <a href={assetUrl('content/previews.json')} download>Download the reviewed preview metadata</a></p></section>
</SiteLayout>
